  "gradeRuleDescribe": {
    "yms_year": 114.0,
    "yms_smester": 1.0,
    "cls_id": "CB02121",
    "sub_id": "53291",
    "scr_dup": "001",
    "tpa_score_new": "<div>各項評分規則在課程投影片中有說明，並且公告在iLearn上</div>\n",
    "tpa_score_new_en": "<div>The grading rules are described in the course slides and announced on iLearn2.</div>\n",
    "course_pol": "每週點名，會有小組討論作業，請互相分享及踴躍發言，並請尊重每個人的發言權。\n若遲到超過15分鐘者，該堂課視為曠課。\n請勿在課堂上飲食。",
    "course_pol_en": "1. Every week during roll call, there will be a group discussion on assignments. \n2. Please share with each other and speak up enthusiastically, and respect everyone's right to speak. \n3. If you are tardy for more than 15 minutes, the class will be considered as an absence. \n4. Please do not eat or drink in class.",
    "course_rem": null,
    "course_rem_en": null,
    "ais_meno": "<div>禁止抄襲，每小組的研究報告需要通過Turnitin比對重複率小於30%的要求。</div>\n\n<div>若使用AI工具，請註明如何使用，所給予的指令有哪些，產出何種結果，在報告組織上如何使用，需要做詳細說明。</div>\n\n<div>個案作業為個人作業，每個人都需要繳交。其他在課堂上的小組討論及小組報告，均會占學期成績&nbsp;</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": "<div>1.Plagiarism is prohibited, and each group&#39;s research report will need to pass the Turnitin Comparison Repeat Rate of less than 30% requirement.<br />\n2. If AI tools are used, please specify how they are used, what instructions are given, what results are produced, and how they are used in the organization of the report.</div>\n",
    "ilearn_mk": "N"
  },
